1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,317
But the reaction is reversible.

2
00:00:02,317 --> 00:00:07,721
In the backward direction, hydronium gives a proton back to acetate.

3
00:00:07,721 --> 00:00:10,338
So there are two acids and two bases.

4
00:00:10,338 --> 00:00:17,786
Acetic acid and acetate differ by exactly one proton: they are a conjugate acid base pair.

5
00:00:17,786 --> 00:00:20,859
Water and hydronium are the other pair.

